    PT --- PC --- PG
    style PT fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    style PC fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px
    style PG fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px